{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"555","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Case of Matryoshkas"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Andrewid the Android is a galaxy-famous detective. He is now investigating the case of vandalism at the exhibition of contemporary art."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The main exhibit is a construction of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" matryoshka dolls that can be nested one into another. The matryoshka dolls are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". A matryoshka with a smaller number can be nested in a matryoshka with a higher number, two matryoshkas can not be directly nested in the same doll, but there may be chain nestings, for example, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 → 2 → 4 → 5"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In one second, you can perform one of the two following operations:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Having a matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" that isn't nested in any other matryoshka and a matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" doesn't contain any other matryoshka and is not nested in any other matryoshka, you may put "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Having a matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" directly contained in matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not nested in any other matryoshka, you may get "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" out of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"According to the modern aesthetic norms the matryoshka dolls on display were assembled in a specific configuration, i.e. as several separate chains of nested matryoshkas, but the criminal, following the mysterious plan, took out all the dolls and assembled them into a single large chain ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 → 2 → ... → n"},{"kind":"text","text":"). In order to continue the investigation Andrewid needs to know in what minimum time it is possible to perform this action."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":") and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of matryoshkas and matryoshka chains in the initial configuration."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the descriptions of the chains: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line first contains number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ mi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), and then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai1, ai2, ..., aimi"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the numbers of matryoshkas in the chain (matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is nested into matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai2"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is nested into matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai3"},{"kind":"text","text":", and so on till the matryoshka "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aimi"},{"kind":"text","text":" that isn't nested into any other matryoshka)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1 + m2 + ... + mk = n"},{"kind":"text","text":", the numbers of matryoshkas in all the chains are distinct, in each chain the numbers of matryoshkas follow in the ascending order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the single line print the minimum number of seconds needed to assemble one large chain from the initial configuration."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\n2 1 2\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 3\n3 1 3 7\n2 2 5\n2 4 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample test there are two chains: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 → 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":". In one second you can nest the first chain into the second one and get "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 → 2 → 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample test you need to disassemble all the three chains into individual matryoshkas in 2 + 1 + 1 = 4 seconds and then assemble one big chain in 6 seconds."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"555A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/555/problem/A"}